                "caption": "Figure 1:Comparison with prior visual difference identification benchmarks. Existing benchmarks primarily focus on open-ended difference captioning and are often limited in visual domains, change categories, or evaluation reliability.VDiff-Benchexpands to 10 fine-grained change categories and evaluates models through challenging multiple-choice questions for more deterministic and objective IDI performance quantization.",
